@description REAPER MCP — Model Context Protocol interface (immersive/spatial audio)
@version 1.13.1
@author James Livingston
@provides
  [darwin] reaper_mcp.dylib https://github.com/inseglet-audio/inseglet/releases/download/v$version/reaper_mcp.dylib
@changelog
  Hygiene release: a user-facing warning no longer cites an internal engineering document.

  `analysis.meter`'s `CROSS_NO_SIBLING` warning -- the one that fires when a digital-silence
  render has no independent read path to check it against -- carried a parenthetical citation
  to a private document. It reached users in the SHIPPED BINARY even though the public source
  tree is scrubbed, because the binary is built from the private source and never passes
  through the scrub.

  The sentence is unchanged in meaning; the citation is removed.

  Surface 190 tools / 4 resources / 5 prompts -- UNMOVED. ctest 28, unmoved.
